      "counterfactual": "If the directory established valve positions and pressure availability, then a normal band indication would confirm supply continuity.",
      "competingExplanation": "None; this is an interpretation of record limitations rather than a causal mechanism for the event itself.",
      "evidenceGap": "No evidence exists to contradict that the area directory does not establish operational states. The gap lies in missing records showing actual valve positions or pressure measurements at specific times during the incident window."
    },
    {
      "fromKey": "n-18cy7rb",
      "toKey": "n-1n5lq96",
      "type": "caused",
      "rationale": "The area directory's limitation (not establishing valve positions or pressure availability) combined with the synthetic nature of the evaluation record means that no definitive causal mechanism for the air interruption can be established from current evidence. The event remains unexplained by known conditions.",
