    "summary": "The current evidence does not support a definitive causal explanation for the instrument-air interruption. The area directory's limitation (not establishing valve positions or pressure availability) means that no operational state can be confirmed from existing records. Competing hypotheses include an unrecorded service-routing change, external factors (third-party work, utility outage), or equipment failure within the distribution system. However, none of these are supported by current evidence.",
